@nafu Candidate builds aren't really a thing anymore so I'm not sure how to do this 😔 A build doesn't appear on the API for a few minutes either. It takes some time to "pre-process" before it actually shows up as processing 😬 

I'm not sure what the correct solution is there. This _may_ have to be a breaking change to where an `app_version` is specified? Or if no `app_version` is specified maybe we show a list of builds the user can select from?

I never really used `deliver` this way so I'm not sure what would be the best approach. Your thoughts would be appreciated! 😊

